  "implementation": "The explicit frame pointer is retained in one terminal machine pseudo through allocation and scheduling. MC output emits adjacent stack assignment and native transfer without an ordinary ABI epilogue. The backend registry and frontend registry each own their respective identities; pruned tables retain stable prior opcode IDs.",
